  "description": "Once the strongest martial artist in the world, So-Cheon Baek sacrificed everything to defeat the ultimate villain. His reward? A shattered dantian, zero power, and a brutal demotion to lowly office worker in a remote regional branch. But don't count this former supreme master out just yet. Starting from rock bottom to rebuild his shattered core, So-Cheon proves his spirit is unbroken. Armed with unmatched battle instincts, he’s ready to smash through red tape, expose deadly martial conspiracies, and reclaim his lost glory! \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
